{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "eb74da638f3b994271dd1e06dfe682b146769da2538e4ca5e98c564b2ba286de", "ja": "おやぶーん！　ねえ、聞いて聞いて！\nたまき、この服、1人で着れるようになったよ！", "zh": "老大──！欸，听环说听环说！\n环学会自己穿上这件衣服了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "ea47928239ae0a1d3e468485bdbc517fb381e2ff53e1a222230febe042d02389", "ja": "これでいつでも、公園に着て行けるぞ～！", "zh": "这样一来，就随时都能穿去公园了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7717b757d17aeb0aa0c77fceb5cd030c34a647a711a19d5f536707277b703063", "ja": "いや、その服は衣装だから。\n公園に行くのはちょっと……。", "zh": "不，那件是表演服装，\n穿去公园不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "1079987be9379620049596ec6d6c274f7fbdd505b69d3cfd6527be7f84cad586", "ja": "えーっ、ダメなの？\n動きやすいから、木登りできると思ったのに……。", "zh": "咦～不行吗？\n因为很好活动，环还以为能穿去爬树的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f5a21ece5d7272cc6de548ea581f7178a63b8ea948869d6d9fcfadfbe1eea1b5", "ja": "うん……そうだな。\n木には、いつもの服で登ったほうがいいな。", "zh": "嗯……这个嘛，\n要爬树的话，还是穿着平常的衣服比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "88475222b0ce22a44a938dde1934c1ef8932d952310ca4ad287c31b1a4965196", "ja": "は！　おやぶん……。\nもしかして、この服、高いの……？", "zh": "啊！老大……\n该不会，这件衣服很贵……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4c92f6c1068c221c70b96621cff2f164d46f824356f4d498fb8f6583f821bdc2", "ja": "衣装の値段か？\nそこは、青羽さんに聞かないとわからないけど……。", "zh": "你问服装的价格吗？\n那要问青羽小姐才知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "d24c9b21bf352fa285f1d561fcf5db34666feda687f1115a9bda90821a8718f4", "ja": "たまき、知ってる……。高い服で遊んじゃダメって、\nお母さんに言われたことある……。", "zh": "环知道……不能穿很贵的衣服去玩，\n妈妈有这么跟环说过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "bb51bbd911c602c5bf71ac9c77e78a4aa7f414988f9b3e9e7d3f905f7b26074e", "ja": "ひらひらした服で木登りしたら、スカートを\n破いちゃって、すっごく怒られたんだ……。", "zh": "以前环穿着有好多花边的衣服去爬树，\n结果扯破了裙子，被骂惨了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "1cf7c9c6406f0a4a9380270e9d5ea55a06d668908643daab91460e6bc18c26df", "ja": "おやつ、抜きだった……。", "zh": "还被罚不准吃点心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1618b679648d6d84d37f2d482c0a28bc25e275be46a59d8e866e74bd7043a03b", "ja": "そ、そうか……そんなことが……\nおやつ抜きは、つらいな……。", "zh": "是、是吗……居然发生了这种事……\n不准吃点心很难过吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "f2bbdd9abf188c8dd69d6b8262d653b610989d194319e7d4fcb2d4648e4dfd82", "ja": "おやぶん、わかったよ！\nたまき、これはステージだけで着る！", "zh": "老大，环知道了！\n那环以后只在舞台上穿它！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6f0081a386f02578e1d671c3d18c11a918d790206b6dc92119ccb79635485341", "ja": "うん、そうだな。えらいぞ、環！", "zh": "嗯，这样才乖。很棒喔，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "91ea599586a53161768f59ad12910fccff918ea6d86cff71cdc06c2391036b35", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん！　劇場から出ないし、\n木にも登らないから、この服、たまに着てもいい？", "zh": "啊，老大！环不会穿出剧场外，也不会穿去爬树的，\n所以平常可以偶尔穿一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc3030f1325a98370e5c997160b65ba94efe7ca9fab6c0015888d852ee86ac17", "ja": "たまき、この服すっごく気に入ってるんだ！\nだから、いっぱい着たい！", "zh": "环很喜欢这件衣服！\n所以想要多穿好几次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1015_p", "source_sha256": "45074ff25b9e219cde425d6186a602a51d428620cd4a01e66ea1b60659080ecf", "ja": "ああ、いいぞ。\nその代わり、汚さないように気をつけてな！", "zh": "嗯，可以啊。\n但条件是，得小心不要弄脏了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0044_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "4945eec01946ba3bcc8ba820f62091e3ad4e3ea8c33fc55d7e841202e5f71ce8", "ja": "うん！　ありがとう、おやぶん！\nくふふ、こぶんにも見せてこよーっと♪", "zh": "嗯！谢谢老大！\n呵呵，也让小弟看看吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
